%% Title: High-level architecture (containers)
%% Summary: Every running container of the compose stack, what runs inside it, the queues between them and the 52-source registry they collect from.
%% Canonical source. architecture.html embeds this definition verbatim and architecture.png is rendered from it (bash docs/diagrams/render.sh).
%% Sources: docker-compose.yml, src/server.js, src/routes/*, src/queues/index.js, src/workers/start.js, public/index.html, src/config/source-registry.js. Spec: TECHNICAL_SPEC.md sections 4, 7, 12, 17.
flowchart LR

  subgraph BROWSER["② Browser · public/"]
    direction TB
    B1["index.html<br/>UMD scripts in contract order"]:::done
